          "line1": "<h1><span class=\"fontsize-4vw\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Addressing instability with&nbsp;<span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\">Modular Dual Mobility and Novae Monobloc Dual Mobility</span></span></span></span></span></h1>\r\n",
