          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Evaluate and identify common indications for using dual mobility</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand the difference in clinical benefits between monobloc and modular dual mobility</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Identify cases in which cemented dual mobility is an appropriate treatment solution</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jul 15 2025 14:04:04 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
