          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Product focus</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Modular Dual Mobility (MDM)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Novae Monobloc Dual Mobility</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
